                    "info": "The James and Younger outlaw gangs ride into town, and it is up to the local marshal, who has lost both his nerve and his gun skills, to stop them.\r",
                    "isHost": true
                },
                {
                    "name": "The Inventor - La più grande truffa della Silicon Valley",
